CI/CD, Terraform on AWS, Kubernetes + Helm, observability, GitOps with
Argo CD and an EKS capstone. Each project has steps, starter code,
'done when' checks, stretch goals and a resume bullet, plus a level
filter and per-browser progress tracking. Linked from the nav, sitemap
and search index.

