+              <li>The API image is under 150 MB and <code>docker compose exec api whoami</code> is not <code>root</code></li>
+            </ul></div>
+          </details>
+          <details>
+            <summary>Stretch goals &amp; résumé bullet</summary>
+            <div class="pj-section">
+              <ul>
+                <li>Scan your images with <code>trivy image</code> and fix HIGH/CRITICAL findings</li>
+                <li>Add a <code>compose.override.yaml</code> for hot reload during development</li>
+              </ul>
+              <p style="margin-top:0.9rem;" class="pj-resume">"Containerised a 3-tier application with multi-stage Docker builds, cutting image size by X% and enabling one-command local environments with Docker Compose."</p>
+            </div>
