+    <h1>Kubernetes for Beginners: Pods, Deployments &amp; Services Explained</h1>
+    <p class="post-lede">Understand the core Kubernetes objects (Pods, Deployments and Services) with manifests and kubectl commands you can run locally.</p>
+    <div class="post-meta">
+      <span>⚙️ Kubernetes</span>
+      <span>📅 <time datetime="2026-02-20">20 Feb 2026</time></span>
+      <span>✎ Updated <time datetime="2026-10-18">18 Oct 2026</time></span>
+      <span>⏱ 2 min read</span>
+      <span>📶 Beginner</span>
+    </div>
+    <div class="post-tags"><span class="post-tag">Kubernetes</span><span class="post-tag">Containers</span><span class="post-tag">Beginner</span></div>
+  </div>
+</header>
