+    <h1>Set Up Prometheus &amp; Grafana Monitoring in 30 Minutes</h1>
+    <p class="post-lede">Deploy kube-prometheus-stack on Kubernetes with Helm, open Grafana and write the PromQL queries every engineer needs.</p>
+    <div class="post-meta">
+      <span>📊 Monitoring</span>
+      <span>📅 <time datetime="2026-03-18">18 Mar 2026</time></span>
+      <span>✎ Updated <time datetime="2026-10-18">18 Oct 2026</time></span>
+      <span>⏱ 2 min read</span>
+      <span>📶 Intermediate</span>
+    </div>
+    <div class="post-tags"><span class="post-tag">Monitoring</span><span class="post-tag">Prometheus</span><span class="post-tag">Grafana</span></div>
+  </div>
+</header>
