+    </div>
+    <div class="qa-chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter by area"><button class="qa-chip active" data-filter-cat="all">All</button><button class="qa-chip" data-filter-cat="kubernetes">☸️ Kubernetes</button><button class="qa-chip" data-filter-cat="docker">🐳 Docker</button><button class="qa-chip" data-filter-cat="terraform">🏗️ Terraform</button><button class="qa-chip" data-filter-cat="cicd">🔁 CI/CD</button><button class="qa-chip" data-filter-cat="linux">🐧 Linux &amp; Network</button></div>
