+  <li>Implement an SLO and burn-rate alert in <a href="projects.html#observability">Project 06: Observability Stack</a>.</li>
+  <li>Read <a href="blog-prometheus-grafana.html">Prometheus &amp; Grafana in 30 Minutes</a>.</li>
+  <li>Practise the <a href="interview.html#observability">SRE interview questions</a>.</li>
+</ul>
