+    <h1>Linux for DevOps: The Commands and Concepts You'll Use Every Day</h1>
+    <p class="post-lede">Filesystem layout, text processing, permissions, processes, systemd, SSH, networking tools and safe Bash scripting: the Linux foundation every DevOps engineer needs.</p>
+    <div class="post-meta">
